# Guardrail fixture — broken local link

This file exists so the `link-existence` check can be watched failing.
It links to [a document that does not exist](./this-file-is-not-here.md).

Stored with a `.fixture` extension so the repository-wide `*.md` scan never
sees it in place; the guardrail runner copies it into `docs/` as `.md` inside a
throwaway tree.
